# The interface headers and the global options the kernel build places in
# this directory: copies of FreeBSD's own generated headers, not repository
# source.  The root .gitignore says the same, but a scanner that only reads
# a .gitignore inside the directory it walks (lizard does) would read
# FreeBSD's macros as if they were ours, so the patterns are repeated here.
*_if.h
opt_*.h
